1794730469.259111 execve("/usr/bin/python3", ["python3", "-c", "import pathlib,sys\nr,m=sys.argv[1],sys.argv[2]\nprint('review',len(r),'message',len(m))\nassert len(r)<=4000 and len(m)<=1200\np=pathlib.Path('/output'); p.mkdir(exist_ok=True)\n(p/'review.md').write_text(r); (p/'message.md').write_text(m)\nprint('wrote', sorted(x.name for x in p.iterdir()))\n", "# GuardianAI release review\n\nReviewer only. Read incoming build-report.json, manifest.json, handoff.md, and handoff-receipt.json. Compared manifest hashes to public source. Did not modify source. Did not fetch the archive, recompile, or run native/notify-launch --abi.\n\n## Checks that passed\n\nHandoff-receipt.json files_sha256 matches the delivered bytes:\n- build-report.json 0d615578a15cf85a16cfc50d60150c6e50b2fa251b378b216a01ca6fe45461ad (216 bytes)\n- manifest.json d082456bfe1342cab51bfb2ffd33cbf7c885cd5605bea9d6b7d2bc9b2e7a05e2 (1723 bytes)\n- handoff.md c1f52372023446cbc397805a54387acb6d0e2c0c9cdacdb56e1f7d5b108c4d3d (799 bytes)\n\nbuild-report.json matches the handoff figures: GuardianAI-linux-x86_64.zip, sha256 7a3005fcb3e36f2e627ca66808b733f9b2cd542d7895fdf3f49edf0615aac9d6, 40092 bytes, native_policy 3, launch_guard_version 1, file_count 15.\n\nmanifest.json files_sha256 has 14 names. SHA-256 matched the public tree for all 12 present files: agent_observer.py, build_release.py, guarded_agent.py, guarded_sessi"..., "# To the builder\n\nReceipt hashes for build-report.json, manifest.json, and handoff.md match the files I received.\n\nFrom build_release.py: files_sha256 is filled before manifest.json is written. The 14 names are the 12 copied sources (including agent_observer.py) plus RUNNING.txt and native/notify-launch. file_count adds 1 for manifest.json, so 15 matches that code. native_policy 3 and launch_guard_version 1 match notify_launch.c, the build ABI gate, seccomp_gate.py, and the manifest. Twelve public-source hashes match. CODING_AGENT.md and PROJECT_DIRECTION.md are outside the map, which fits the stated core-runtime scope.\n\nI could not verify archive sha256 7a3005fcb3e36f2e627ca66808b733f9b2cd542d7895fdf3f49edf0615aac9d6, size 40092, or that the zip contains agent_observer.py. GuardianAI-linux-x86_64.zip was not in the handoff. native/notify-launch (91491b52...) and RUNNING.txt (0571b170...) are not in the public tree. Please treat those three digests as unverified. Eval of the RUNNING.txt literal failed with Sy"...], 0x7ffe747d17c0 /* 3 vars */) = 0
